<title>USA: Alba-Waldensian names new chief executive.</title>
<headline>Alba-Waldensian names new chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>VALDESE, N.C. 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alba-Waldensian Inc on Monday said Lee Mortenson was named president and chief executive officer, replacing Thomas Schuster.</p>
<p>Mortenson has been a director of Alba-Waldensian since 1984. Alba-Waldensian makes and markets women's hosiery and intimate apparel.  </p>
<p>A company spokesman was not available for details about Schuster's departure.  </p>
<p>A company spokesman later said Schuster resigned to pursue other interests.</p>
</text>
